{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13d0_level_act13d0_st03",
  "groupId": "act13d0",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "不知返",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13d0/level_act13d0_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "819611c6184a155414300c725f15de6bd7e3efd311a8f284a93256ab7bf7f26b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "中秋 极境"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我們一生都在飛翔，有誰想過，自己最後會停在哪兒嗎？\n帶著濕意的家鄉的風，口中總有消散不去鹹鹽的滋味。\n刺疼人的烈日，難忍的高溫，還有繁華留在皮膚上的印記和空曠城市中凝滯的氣流。\n我體驗過，這些我都體驗過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我想或許有一天，我終究會回到那個地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "10:10 A.M.  天氣/晴\n羅德島艦船，第二艙室，幹員休息區"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，這次聯繫大家的事情就拜託極境先生了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要採購的食材我已經提前和後勤部門說好了，到時菜品我會和食鐵獸姐一起想想辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "家常菜我們應該都能做，但複雜點的就要找人幫忙了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，對了，驚蟄姐也說可以幫忙寫請柬，她字寫得可好看了，動作俐落又帥氣，看得我都心動想去學書法了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，準備得很周到嘛，真沒想到那個驚蟄小姐竟然也會幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要聯絡的就是名單上這些外勤任務中的炎國和龍門幹員對吧？放心交給我，絕對一個都漏不掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有極境先生幫忙，我當然不擔心啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能在羅德島遇到這麼多老鄉，還挺讓人意外的。嘿嘿，我好喜歡大家聚在一起時的氣氛，人多一點才熱鬧嘛，多好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道在外面出任務的大家能不能回得來，希望可以趕上......唔，我也知道估計會很難啦，但是萬一呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，當然也很歡迎大家一起參加！極境先生要來嗎，可以帶上朋友一起，這種活動如果人少就沒意思了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的？那太好了，我一定多拉點人一起去，這麼難得的機會那可不能錯過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是越熱鬧越好對吧？這個我們擅長！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊哈哈......當然歡迎，不過，也不要鬧得太過火哦，之後會被凱爾希醫生罵的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心放心，我有分寸的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不想被罵，奉勸你還是別邀請這傢伙比較好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果惹禍也是天賦，那他的確天賦異稟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，棘刺先生，早上好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，老兄，這麼說就不對了，論惹禍明明你也沒比我好多少吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上次把接弦區的船板弄壞的人可是你欸，為什麼事後可露希爾小姐反而拉著我教訓了那麼久啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怎麼知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道不是因為你把她的小機器抱去甲板上玩，結果掉下去摔碎了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": ".....呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那、那該怪誰啊！還不是安哲拉她突然用墨彈一通亂射，我一時沒反應過來才會失手啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，等一下，安哲拉小姐怎麼會在甲板上射擊？她看起來不像是會做這種事情的人呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "試試手。我剛給她的弩加了點新東西，仿拉特蘭銃的射擊效果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果還不是你害的！怪不得那個拉特蘭銃迷突然就興奮了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了......咦，誰在那邊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！是小艾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你躲在那裡幹什麼呢，快過來這邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，難道你是怕生？放心，這兩位先生一點都不可怕的，而且這不是還有我在嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，清流姐，別拉，我自己走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉，打擾你們了嗎？我只是想找棘刺先生商量點事情，如果不方便的話，過一會也可以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完全不會哦。沒什麼不方便，大家都是同事有什麼打擾不打擾的，太見外了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兄弟，找你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你成天板著臉，我還以為沒有女孩子敢和你說話呢，真讓人欣慰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......囉嗦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你找我有事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。很抱歉，突然來打擾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實是有關武器的保養，有些想向棘刺先生請教的地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，這傢伙的那套武器保養這麼有名的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼說起來，我的發信器也差不多該整修一下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，你們說，我下次任務回來給可露希爾小姐帶點禮物，她會不會原諒我，幫我給發信器升個級？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你還是帶她討厭的那種蒜味零食，那麼肯定不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的武器帶了嗎，讓我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這裡，請看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我使用的武器和一般術師使用的施術單元不太一樣，裡面的一些零件的保養方法比較複雜......啊，請小心一些，這裡的扳機有些鬆動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很老舊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種款式的施術單元，是烏薩斯的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是的。原本的使用者是我的父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我問過赫拉格老先生，他告訴我，這把法杖需要好好養護一下，否則之後很可能會影響到性能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而棘刺先生很擅長調配這一類用來保養兵器的試劑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個......突然這麼拜託實在很不好意思，但是如果可以的話，能不能——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能不能請棘刺先生幫忙......欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說，可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好最近我有新想法，如果你能放心交給我，可以試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，啊，好的。謝、謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了呢，小艾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可不要拿什麼奇怪的東西出來實驗啊，你做的藥劑我是不懷疑，但是每次剛做出來的東西效果都怪怪的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼自信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在你的武器上試過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？啊啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開玩笑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們一直都這樣？......關係真好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是哦，這兩位算是老鄉嘛，我看他們伊比利亞那一塊出來的幹員，好像關係都還挺不錯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟出門在外，他鄉遇故知果然還是很不一樣吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當初大明星食鐵獸小姐給我簽名的時候我也開心得不得了，她在我們家那邊可有名了，大叔大嬸們都喜歡她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在我們都熟到能一起出去逛街了呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，對對，還有驚蟄小姐也是，看著是有點凶，其實人超級好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你見過她怎麼對付壞掉的錄影機嗎？就這麼“啪”地一下，“咚”地錘上去，我還以為會被拍壞呢，沒想到真的修好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "電器不是一直都這麼修理的嗎？接觸不良的時候敲敲就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼說也是，我老家大家也都這麼幹。蠻有效的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。不行就多拍兩下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯沒錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣啊，原來他們是同鄉人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，打起精神來，不要這副表情！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就知道，你還是在意凜冬同學她們幾個人對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次我陪你一起去，烈夏同學我還挺熟的，她很好說話的！不管有什麼問題，大家都得先認識之後才好溝通嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。我也這麼覺得。遲早要和她們聊一聊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你，清流姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎......你別這樣，這麼正經地道謝，我反而會害羞啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，真不錯，友情耀眼啊，是不是？我就是喜歡看到這種場面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這讓我能想起自己剛來羅德島的時候，也是這麼怕生害羞......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你確定你有這種時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然有！你別總是拆我的台！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算是我也是需要適應期的，當時的情況和現在差得挺遠，羅德島還沒有那麼多人，大家也都比現在要嚴肅多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，是這樣嗎？凱爾希醫生的話，感覺確實一直都會這麼嚴肅，但是其他人也是嗎？可露希爾小姐呢？還有阿米婭呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希醫生那當然啦！可露希爾小姐當時忙得整天見不到人，等到把艦內整得差不多了，才稍微閑下來，又開始搗鼓那些機械。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我想想，要說我剛來的時候，那都是兩年前了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個時候阿米婭都還是個小孩子呢，比現在還矮一點，小芽菜似的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，雖然要我說，她現在也還算不上是大人，但是看她的表情，已經完全不一樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩年多前，那時候博士是什麼樣的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，博士也在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個人沒有比我們早來多久吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣嗎，但是，我聽說博士原本就是羅德島的一員？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......這個問題啊，這個問題不太好回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說實話，我也搞不清之前到底發生了什麼，好像是在我來之前曾經出過什麼事，知情的人不多，隊長也不和我提。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之在龍門那件事之前，我也從沒見過博士啦。Ace大哥他們倒是偶爾會提起博士這麼個人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎麼說，現在不也挺好的？阿米婭，凱爾希醫生，還有博士三個人相處得也不錯，新幹員也漸漸多起來，以後肯定會越來越熱鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼一看，當初我決定留下果然是正確的，我已經受夠壓抑無聊的地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在就算不做信使，也能有機會到處走走，看到很多不一樣的風景，最後還有個能回的地方，嗯嗯，這樣就足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說到這個，你離開後有沒有回去過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說哪兒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊比利亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完全沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他的先不說......那裡現在根本回不去吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得，極境先生和棘刺先生的家鄉都是伊比利亞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前我都沒怎麼聽說過那裡，那是個什麼樣的地方呢？如果回不去的話，大家不會想家嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，嗯，這個嘛，想還是會想的啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，抱歉，我是不是問了什麼不該問的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，也沒有那麼誇張，只是該怎麼說呢，嗯，仔細想想，好像也沒有什麼特別值得一提的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不要露出那種表情啦，我倒不是有什麼慘痛回憶，只是......嗯，伊比利亞是個對我來說比較無聊的地方吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老家會很無聊......嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無聊。那裡太壓抑了，簡直讓人喘不過氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒法在那裡生活，所以就離開了，只是這樣哦。其他的，那裡也不算很差吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那只是你的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對阿戈爾人，伊比利亞沒有那麼友好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......好像確實有這麼回事，我知道的不多，我生活的那座城裡，阿戈爾人很少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很多人只能在城市邊緣遊蕩，或者堅持住在封鎖線旁，被裁判所追逐。能安穩生活的才是少數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們抓很多人，許多對於他們來說，切實有威脅的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，是這樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽起來很可怕。我記得，清流姐也是阿戈爾人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......但是炎國什麼人都有，好像不怎麼在意這種事，也沒聽說阿戈爾就不能做官員，大家都一樣嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼說來，羅德島也不是很在意這些呢，我剛來的時候也很受大家照顧，第一次出外勤任務好像就是和極境先生一起的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是。上次任務時，我完全沒有發現躲藏起來的敵人，多虧了極境先生......非常感謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不用客氣，因為我經常被調到不同的小隊裡嘛，大家都是隊友，互相幫助是應該的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算你這麼說，對恩義還是應該好好道謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，小苦艾，在這種地方真的很頑固。我身邊還真有不少這種人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比如你那個隊長？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然隊長她也是，但你有沒有意識到你自己也頑固得像臭石頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那位隊長總是不說話，看起來就很酷呢......說出來不好意思，其實我有點點怕她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白，我明白，這人看起來就很凶嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過呢，其實隊長只是長得凶，平常又沒辦法和大家交流，實際上她很好說話的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次遇見她的話，不如試試看和她打個招呼，那個人會很高興哦，雖然可能看不出來，但是我可以擔保！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩位關係真的很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算是吧......不管怎麼說，畢竟我這條命都是隊長救回來的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再說，那人沒我的能力輔助根本不行，要不然當初做個信使到處走走才是我的第一志願。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，太受歡迎也很傷腦筋啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怎麼記得她這次是一個人出去任務了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒你輔助不行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這次的任務不一樣！那種潛入任務只有隊長能勝任，我跟著去反而太顯眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我之前，她根本就沒和什麼人組隊過吧？最開始合作的時候真是有夠嗆的，那時候她竟然還因為嫌我煩就直接對我動手欸，過不過分？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隊長的源石技藝真的很凶，就挨了那一下，我差點意識混亂到把回家的路線都忘了，之後好久都分不清自己是誰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "影響到意識......還有記憶？羅德島還有人掌握這樣危險的能力嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我頭一次聽說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，嗯，這的確也不是大家平常會拿出來說的事情啦。姑且算是秘密情報，兩位可別往外說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之，小苦艾不用太拘束，大家都很好相處，有什麼不明白的地方隨時可以來問我，我非常樂意為大家效勞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差不多就是這傢伙說的這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但不必勉強，就按你自己的節奏來，有問題找誰都行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "speakerId": "char_405_absin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說得太對啦！千萬不要勉強自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好，小艾這次也來參加我們的慶祝吧？極境先生和棘刺先生也請一起來，我請大家嘗嘗我家的家鄉菜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一年一度的節日呢，不大吃一頓可不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦！真讓人期待啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清流",
      "speakerId": "char_385_finlpp",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，請期待吧，保證不會讓人失望~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "灰白色的城市。壓抑。沒意思。僅此而已嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你對那裡的印象只有這樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎......我們的情況不一樣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我確實沒什麼好說的，那裡對我來說只是單調無聊，確實只有這樣而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且，也不能真的和她們說得太詳細吧，那裡面還有一個還沒成年呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你該不會忘了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個小姑娘可還是個學生，而且還是節日相關的話題呢，人家高高興興的，我們就別說那些掃興的事情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "家鄉......啊。不知道那裡現在變成什麼樣子了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "建築還是那麼繁瑣，風還是帶著水氣，有那種鹹味嗎？街上是不是還是空空蕩蕩，人人噤聲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棘刺",
      "speakerId": "char_293_thorns",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你問誰？我哪知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，兄弟，你說，像我們這樣跑出來的，今後還有沒有機會回去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可不怎麼想回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我總有種預感，或許總有一天......我總會回到那個地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
